			"notes": "## Minecraft 26.3 support\n\nAdds a 26.3 build with Java 25, Fabric Loader 0.19.5+, and Fabric API 0.161.0+26.3. Minecraft 1.21 / 1.21.1 remains supported.\n\nUpdates the optional client HUD, settings, key mappings, and custom material ordering for the new rendering and input APIs. Right click cycles backwards; the max-lines field accepts digits up to 999. Client state is cleared on the client thread when disconnecting.\n\nSaved active lists now load immediately when a dedicated server starts. Keep `config/mankelist/` and `mankelist-*.json` when updating to retain lists, checks, claims, followers, and stock areas.\n\nVerified with a real 26.3 dedicated server and client: list networking, HUD text and item icons, settings and persistence, material ordering, and disconnect cleanup."
		},
